      {
        "claim_id": "dates",
        "retained_statement": "A birthday and current work coverage do not establish when Part B actually starts. Social Security confirms the enrollment route and effective date. Unknown dates stay unknown. The timeline uses the facts entered in this tab. An unknown date stays an open check; special enrollment rights may need separate confirmation.",
        "local_evidence": {
