      },
      {
        "claim_id": "drugs",
        "retained_statement": "Part D helps pay for prescription medicines. With Original Medicare, you can join a separate Medicare drug plan. Most Medicare Advantage plans include Part D. Check the exact drug list, restrictions, pharmacy, and costs before relying on coverage for a particular medicine.",
        "local_evidence": {
