        "retained_statement": "Medicare Supplement Insurance, a private policy that helps pay your share of costs under Original Medicare. Same thing as a Supplement. It works with Original Medicare, not Medicare Advantage. Drug coverage is separate. Check your enrollment rights before changing existing coverage.",
